{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_0","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"blind_id\":\"HOX030\",\"coverage\":[{\"point\":1,\"credit\":1,\"reason\":\"States that the ICAV is the single legal entity and its sub-funds are not separate legal persons.\"},{\"point\":2,\"credit\":0.5,\"reason\":\"Explains that liabilities are segregated between sub-funds and the ICAV acts for them, but does not explicitly state that the ICAV can sue or be sued for a particular sub-fund.\"}],\"central_error\":null,\"local_error\":null,\"grade\":\"partial\",\"rationale\":\"The answer covers the legal-personality distinction and gives substantive information about segregated liability, but incompletely covers the ICAV’s ability to sue or be sued for a particular sub-fund.\"}"}}
